 | 4 | ≈1.06× | ≈1.06× | orders every three days |\n\n2. **How often to order.**\n   - **Every other day (7 vs 2):** saves 14 × 26 = 364 in order fees. But one day's demand of both products sits in storage overnight, adding about (19 × 0.9 + 24 × 0.8) ≈ 36 per two-day cycle, so about 470 for the month. That's more than the saving.\n   - **Every three days (4):** saves about 470 in fees but adds about 1,000 in storage. Its large deliveries also come close to the 140-unit capacity.\n\nCandidate 2 has the closest order sizes to the target and the more favourable trade-off between fees and storage."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3624, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3624}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T14:22:51.793Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQzoKxNogsXN4BQ336Fu"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_011uH76iZvRcMrGRnL2BeWad", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQzoLFEXyRbuFU1KeijR", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_011uH76iZvRcMrGRnL2BeWad", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 2}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3624, "cache_read_input_